 <h3><u>Is Tarha Se Jeene Ka Hunar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p><span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>Is Tarha Se Jeene Ka Hunar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)……2</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>Rag Rag Me Wafadariyan Bhar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>Is Tarha Se Jeene Ka Hunar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)……</span><br> <br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>Yeh Aaise Sakhi, Aaise Sakhi, Aaise Sakhi Hain…..2</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>Kuch Maange Bina Jholiyan Bhar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)</span><br> <br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>Jo Shahre Wafa Ke Liye Jaate Hain Safar Ko…..2</span><br> <span grande,tahoma,verdana,arial,sans-serif; font-size:12.727272033691406px>Un Logon Ko Saaman E Safar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)<br> <br> Roze Ki Ziyarat Se Yeh Ehsas Hua<br> Hai…..2<br> Binae Tawanaie Se Bhar Dete Hain<br> Abbas (A.s.)<br> <br> Jo Kufr Ke Lashkar Se Bhara Hota Hai Aksar…..2<br> Maidan Wahi Lashon Se Bhar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)<br> <br> Jo Shaks Yahan Rota Hai Shabbir (A.s.) ke Gham Mein…..2<br> Khush Ho Ke Ushe Khuld Mein Ghar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)<br> <br> Jub Koi Bayan Karta Hai Shabbir (A.s.) Ki Midhat…..2<br> Lehje Me Qaiyamat Ka Asar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)<br> <br> Shabbir (A.S) Ka Dushman Ho Mukabil To Zuban Ko…..2<br> Lafzon Ke Tabarraie Tabar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)<br> <br> Sadqe Mein Sakina (S.a.) Ke Kabhi<br> Maang Ke Dekho…..2<br> Kuza Hi Nahi Jholi Bhi Bhar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)<br> <br> Masoom Sakina (S.a.) Ko Jo Pani Na Pila Paaie…..2<br> Woh Hath Juda Jism Se Kardete Hain Abbas (A.s.)<br> <br> Gazi (A.s.) Ka Qasida Kiya Tahreer To Jaana<br> Lafzon Ke Aewaz Daad O Gohar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)<br> <br> Is Tarha Jeene Ka Hunar Dete Hain<br> Abbas (A.s.)<br> Rag Rag Mein Wafadariyan Bhar Dete Hain Abbas (A.s.)</span></p> 
